                },
                "ordered": false,
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "Founder & CEO: Amit Bansal\nVisionary entrepreneur and engineer; previously worked at global automotive majors.",
                    "depth": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Co-Founder & CTO: Priya Mehra\nHolds a PhD in Automotive Engineering, driving technological advancement and R&D.",
                    "depth": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Head of Operations: Rakesh Singh",
                    "depth": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Chief Financial Officer: Sunita Rao",
                    "depth": 0
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "location": {
                  "line": 30,
                  "heading": "Key Ownership & Leadership"
                },
                "text": "The company remains privately held by the founding group, with a minority stake held by a consortium of green-tech investors since 2020."
              }
            ],
            "sections": []
          },
